## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Main
    * data
        * minecraft
            * tags
				* function
					> tick.json
        * combat
			+ loot_table
				+ dorf1_lagerhaus_bossmob.json
            * function
				> test_enemy.mcfunction
				* tick
	                + remove_ex_orbs.mcfunction
	                + > tick_switch_combat.mcfunction >>> renaming and edit <<<
		* quests_dorf1
			* function
				* dorfvorsteher
					* lagerhaus
						* mob
							> mob.mcfunction



### Files: (Kommenrtare entfernt)
## tick.json
{
    "replace": false,
    "values": [
        "respawn:tick/switch",
        "base:remove_villager_trading",
        "teleport:entities/entity_control",
        "weather:control_switch_weather",
        "quests_dorf1:trigger/trigger_action",
        "combat:tick/tick_switch_combat"
    ]
}

## dorf1_lagerhaus_bossmob.json 
{
  "pools": [
    {
      "rolls": 1,
      "entries": [
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:rotten_flesh",
          "weight": 1,
          "functions": [
            {
              "function": "minecraft:set_count",
              "count": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

## test_enemy.mcfunction 
kill @e[tag=test_enemy]

execute positioned ^ ^ ^4 run summon minecraft:pillager ~ 65 ~ {NoAI:1b,CustomName:"Test_Enemy",CustomNameVisible:1b,Tags:["test_enemy"],Silent:1b,Health:1.0f}


## remove_ex_orbs.mcfunction 
execute if entity @e[type=experience_orb] run kill @e[type=experience_orb]


## tick_switch_combat.mcfunction 
function combat:tick/set_base

function combat:tick/remove_xp_orbs


## mob.mcfunction 
execute at @e[tag=dorf1_lagerhaus_marker_mob_boss] run summon zombie_villager ~ ~ ~ {VillagerData:{type:plains,profession:farmer,level:99},Tags:["dorf1_lagerhaus_mob","dorf1_lagerhaus_mob_boss"],CustomName:[{text:Kadaver}],Health:1.0,attributes:[{id:max_health,base:1.0f}],DeathLootTable:"combat:dorf1_lagerhaus_bossmob"}

scoreboard players set _isBoss Quest_Dorf1_Lagerhaus 1